-- Afya Pharmacy story seed (plan.md phase 1, step 5).
--
-- The board's story, for demos and tests: both branches and the staff,
-- the 12 catalogue medicines with their batches, prescriptions RX-2210 to
-- RX-2219, the patients Ali Hassan and Mzee Salim R., the controlled
-- register balance of 80, order UZ-7781 and recall RC-0047, and the
-- insurance batches.
--
-- The story's "today" is 2026-10-04: the dashboard's day, the day RX-2210
-- was dispensed at 14:05 and the register was counted at 08:15. Every
-- figure below is copied from the boards in design/pharmacy; where a board
-- shows a rounded tile (5 batches worth 186,400), the rows here add up to
-- it exactly.
--
-- The whole seed runs in one transaction (load_sql_file wraps it). It
-- starts by deleting the story's organization, which cascades to every row
-- below, so loading it twice is the same as loading it once.
--
-- Identifiers are fixed UUID version 7 values so the rows can be referred
-- to from tests:
--   0001 organization        0002/0003 branches       0011/0012 staff
--   0021..0024 stock locations                       0101..0112 medicines
--   0201..0212 medicine details                      0301..0322 batches
--   0401..0422 opening movements 0501..0517 levels   0601..0613 patients
--   0701/0702 prescribers      0801..0810 prescriptions
--   0901..0915 prescription items                    0a01 sale RX-2210
--   0a11..0a14 sale lines      0a21 payment          0b01 insurer
--   0b10/0b11 clinical profiles 0b20/0b21 claim batches
--   0b30 claim RX-2210         0b40 interaction rule
--   0c01..0c04 controlled register entries           0d01 supplier
--   0d10 purchase order UZ-7781 0d11..0d16 its lines
--   0e01 recall RC-0047        0e11..0e14 recall actions

delete from core.organizations where id = '00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001';

